                                        "entry_id": "95bc3b5f-8567-399c-a170-6456322a4747",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the capability to suppress the immune system, capable of immunosuppression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a73982d4-30e2-4104-aa5e-408d330b8988",
                                                "sense_id": "a1f3d69b-1d23-37e2-ba80-5ee3c9f39366",
                                                "text": "It is predictable that some of these infections occur in individuals immunocompromised by malnutrition or underlying disease (notably cancer or AIDS) or by immunosuppressive therapy."
                                            }
